        "id": "U10-D5",
        "statement": "Borrowing has a new reservation guard, in the same place in the guard order as before. A set-aside copy may go only to its member. Any other copy may go only to the head of the holds with no copy set aside (DEC-005), or to anyone when there are none. A suspended member at the head of the waiting holds still blocks free copies, as before L10. Copies freed by borrowing or expiry are not set aside again; they follow the free-copy rule (\u0027simply free\u0027). Renewal is unchanged: any hold on the book, set aside or waiting, still blocks renewal (LEND-L03).",
